+</head>
+<body>
+  <aside class="sidebar" aria-label="文档导航">
+    <a class="brand" href="#overview"><span class="brand-mark"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 4v16M5 8h8a5 5 0 0 1 5 5v7"/><circle cx="5" cy="4" r="2" fill="#26362d"/><circle cx="5" cy="20" r="2" fill="#26362d"/><circle cx="18" cy="20" r="2" fill="#26362d"/></svg></span><span>工程手册<small>ENGINEERING HANDBOOK</small></span></a>
+    <div class="workspace"><span>E</span>团队协作空间<span>⌘</span></div>
+    <div class="nav-label">WORKFLOW / 工作流</div>
+    <nav>
+      <a class="nav-link active" href="#overview" aria-current="location"><span class="num">00</span>规范概览</a>
+      <a class="nav-link" href="#branches"><span class="num">01</span>分支命名</a>
+      <a class="nav-link" href="#commits"><span class="num">02</span>提交信息</a>
+      <a class="nav-link" href="#reviews"><span class="num">03</span>代码评审</a>
+      <a class="nav-link" href="#quickstart"><span class="num">04</span>快速开始</a>
+    </nav>
+    <div class="sidebar-note"><span class="status-dot"></span>持续改进，小步前行。<br><span style="padding-left:13px">Better together, commit by commit.</span></div>
+  </aside>
+  <div class="shell">
+    <header class="topbar"><div class="breadcrumb"><span>工程手册</span><span>/</span><span>团队协作</span><span>/</span><strong>Git 使用规范</strong></div><div class="top-tag"><span class="status-dot"></span>团队标准</div></header>
+    <main class="page">
+      <section class="hero" id="overview">
+        <div class="eyebrow">THE WAY WE BUILD</div>
+        <h1>让每一次提交，都有迹可循。</h1>
+        <p class="lead">团队 Git 协作规范<br>用一致的分支命名、清晰的提交信息和有效的代码评审，让协作更顺畅，让代码更可靠。</p>
+        <div class="meta"><span class="pill">v1.0</span><span>适用范围：团队所有代码仓库</span><span>约 5 分钟阅读</span></div>
+        <svg class="hero-decoration" width="100" height="135" viewBox="0 0 100 135" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M24 15v105M24 90c0-35 51-18 51-51V15" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="24" cy="19" r="6" fill="#f7f8f4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="24" cy="66" r="6" fill="#f7f8f4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="24" cy="117" r="6" fill="#f7f8f4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="75" cy="18" r="6" fill="#e1e9d8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/></svg>
+      </section>
+      <div class="principles">
+        <article class="principle"><span class="principle-icon"><svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 5v14M18 5v4c0 5-12 3-12 8"/><circle cx="6" cy="5" r="2" fill="#edf3e8"/><circle cx="18" cy="5" r="2" fill="#edf3e8"/><circle cx="6" cy="19" r="2" fill="#edf3e8"/></svg></span><div><h3>一个分支，一件事</h3><p>保持变更聚焦，降低协作成本</p></div></article>
+        <article class="principle"><span class="principle-icon"><svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12h5m8 0h5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/></svg></span><div><h3>每次提交，表达意图</h3><p>让历史记录成为有用的上下文</p></div></article>
+        <article class="principle"><span class="principle-icon"><svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3l8 3v6c0 5-8 9-8 9S4 17 4 12V6l8-3Z"/><path d="m8 12 3 3 5-6"/></svg></span><div><h3>先评审，再合并</h3><p>让质量成为团队共同的责任</p></div></article>
+      </div>
+      <section id="branches">
+        <div class="section-heading"><span class="section-num">01</span><h2>分支命名</h2></div>
+        <p class="section-desc">采用轻量分支工作流：从 main 创建短期分支，通过 Pull Request（PR）合并回主分支。</p>
+        <div class="branch-map">
+          <svg viewBox="0 0 180 61" fill="none" role="img" aria-label="main 分支创建功能分支，评审后合并回 main"><path d="M10 17h160" stroke="#829c70" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M35 17c15 0 10 31 29 31h44c16 0 14-31 31-31" stroke="#b3c19d" stroke-width="2"/><g fill="#edf1e7" stroke="#829c70" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="15" cy="17" r="4"/><circle cx="35" cy="17" r="4"/><circle cx="139" cy="17" r="4"/><circle cx="167" cy="17" r="4"/></g><g fill="#b3c19d"><circle cx="72" cy="48" r="4"/><circle cx="98" cy="48" r="4"/></g><text x="78" y="11" fill="#718465" font-size="9" font-family="monospace">main</text></svg>
+          <div><strong>主分支保持可发布，功能分支保持短生命周期。</strong><p>命名格式：<code>&lt;type&gt;/&lt;issue-id&gt;-&lt;short-description&gt;</code>，例如 <code>feat/123-user-login</code>。</p></div>
+        </div>
+        <div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>分支类型</th><th>使用场景</th><th>命名示例</th></tr></thead><tbody>
+          <tr><td><code class="branch-name">main</code></td><td>稳定主分支，受保护，禁止直接推送</td><td><code>main</code></td></tr>
+          <tr><td><code class="branch-name">feat/</code></td><td>开发新功能</td><td><code>feat/123-user-login</code></td></tr>
+          <tr><td><code class="branch-name">fix/</code></td><td>修复常规缺陷</td><td><code>fix/128-token-expiry</code></td></tr>
+          <tr><td><code class="branch-name">hotfix/</code></td><td>紧急修复线上问题</td><td><code>hotfix/130-payment-timeout</code></td></tr>
+          <tr><td><code class="branch-name">refactor/</code></td><td>重构代码，不改变外部行为</td><td><code>refactor/135-auth-service</code></td></tr>
+          <tr><td><code class="branch-name">docs/ · chore/</code></td><td>文档、依赖与构建维护</td><td><code>docs/140-api-guide</code></td></tr>
+        </tbody></table></div>
+        <div class="note"><span class="note-icon">ⓘ</span><div><b>命名约定</b>　使用小写英文、数字和短横线；描述简短且具体，不使用姓名或含糊的 <code>temp</code>、<code>test</code>。没有工单时可省略编号，例如 <code>docs/update-readme</code>。</div></div>
+      </section>
+      <section id="commits">
+        <div class="section-heading"><span class="section-num">02</span><h2>提交信息</h2></div>
+        <p class="section-desc">遵循 Conventional Commits 结构。用一句话说清“改了什么”，必要时在正文补充原因与影响。</p>
+        <div class="format"><div class="code-header"><span><i></i><i></i><i></i>COMMIT MESSAGE</span><button class="copy" type="button" data-copy="commit-example">复制示例</button></div><div class="code-body"><pre><span class="code-comment"># &lt;type&gt;[optional scope][!]: &lt;description&gt;</span>
+<code id="commit-example"><span class="code-accent">feat(auth):</span> 支持使用邮箱验证码登录
+
+为未设置密码的用户提供登录入口，验证码有效期为 5 分钟。
+
+Refs: #123</code></pre></div></div>
+        <div class="commit-grid"><div class="commit-type"><code>feat</code><span>新增功能</span></div><div class="commit-type"><code>fix</code><span>缺陷修复</span></div><div class="commit-type"><code>docs</code><span>文档更新</span></div><div class="commit-type"><code>refactor</code><span>代码重构</span></div><div class="commit-type"><code>test</code><span>测试变更</span></div><div class="commit-type"><code>chore</code><span>日常维护</span></div></div>
+        <ul class="guidelines"><li><code>scope</code> 可选，用模块名标识影响范围，如 <code>auth</code>、<code>api</code>；格式调整用 <code>style</code>，性能优化用 <code>perf</code>，流水线变更用 <code>ci</code>。</li><li>标题建议不超过 72 个字符，使用“添加、修复、移除”等动作描述，避免“更新代码”或“fix bug”。每次提交只包含一个逻辑变更。</li><li>正文与标题空一行；不兼容变更在类型或范围后添加 <code>!</code>，并在页脚用 <code>BREAKING CHANGE:</code> 说明影响和迁移方式。</li><li>提交前检查暂存区，不提交密钥、凭据、本地配置或构建产物；需要忽略的文件写入 <code>.gitignore</code>。</li></ul>
+      </section>
+      <section id="reviews">
+        <div class="section-heading"><span class="section-num">03</span><h2>代码评审流程</h2></div>
+        <p class="section-desc">所有进入 main 的变更都需要 PR。让上下文先到位，让讨论围绕代码和问题展开。</p>
+        <div class="flow"><article class="step"><span class="step-number">STEP 01</span><h3>创建 PR</h3><p>同步主分支，完成自检。<br>未完成的工作标记为 Draft。</p></article><article class="step"><span class="step-number">STEP 02</span><h3>自动检查</h3><p>运行 lint、测试与构建。<br>修复失败项后再请求评审。</p></article><article class="step"><span class="step-number">STEP 03</span><h3>同行评审</h3><p>邀请相关模块的维护者。<br>讨论、修改并请求复审。</p></article><article class="step"><span class="step-number">STEP 04</span><h3>合并与清理</h3><p>满足合并条件后 Squash。<br>删除已合并的远端分支。</p></article></div>
+        <div class="review-grid">
+          <article class="review-card"><h3 class="card-title"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m14 4 6 6M4 20l5-1L21 7l-4-4L5 15l-1 5Z"/></svg>作为提交者</h3><ul class="checklist"><li><span><strong>说明背景：</strong>为什么改、改了什么，关联工单。</span></li><li><span><strong>提供证据：</strong>测试结果、界面截图与复现步骤。</span></li><li><span><strong>控制范围：</strong>一个 PR 解决一件事，大变更合理拆分。</span></li><li><span><strong>标明风险：</strong>兼容性、迁移步骤和必要的回滚方案。</span></li><li><span><strong>闭环反馈：</strong>逐条回应意见，修改后说明并请求复审。</span></li></ul></article>
+          <article class="review-card"><h3 class="card-title"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 11c0 5-4 8-9 8H8l-5 3V7c0-3 4-5 9-5s9 4 9 9Z"/><path d="m8 10 3 3 5-6"/></svg>作为评审者</h3><ul class="checklist"><li><span><strong>优先正确性：</strong>关注边界条件、异常处理和安全性。</span></li><li><span><strong>检查可维护性：</strong>设计、命名、复杂度与测试覆盖。</span></li><li><span><strong>明确优先级：</strong>区分“必须修改”与“可选建议”。</span></li><li><span><strong>给出理由：</strong>指出问题与影响，提供可执行的建议。</span></li><li><span><strong>及时响应：</strong>建议一个工作日内首次反馈，无法评审时转交。</span></li></ul></article>
